
@startuml
title Projectory - Account Registration & Login
autonumber

actor Student
participant "React Frontend" as React
participant "FastAPI Backend" as API
database "PostgreSQL / Supabase" as DB

Student -> React: Open Login / Sign Up page
React --> Student: Display authentication form

alt New Student - Registration
    Student -> React: Enter name, email, password
    React -> API: Submit registration information
    API -> API: Validate required fields and password
    API -> DB: Check if email already exists
    DB --> API: Email lookup result

    alt Email already registered or invalid input
        API --> React: Registration error
        React --> Student: Display error message
    else Valid registration
        API -> DB: Create student account
        DB --> API: Account created
        API --> React: Registration successful
        React --> Student: Display confirmation
    end

else Existing Student - Login
    Student -> React: Enter email and password
    React -> API: Submit login credentials
    API -> DB: Retrieve account by email
    DB --> API: Account information
    API -> API: Verify password

    alt Invalid credentials
        API --> React: Authentication error
        React --> Student: Display login error
    else Valid credentials
        API --> React: Authentication success
        React --> Student: Display dashboard
    end
end

opt Student logs out
    Student -> React: Click Logout
    React -> React: Clear local authentication state
    React --> Student: Return to login page
end

@enduml
